WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.830
Every seventh year, some farmers
in Israel stop sowing their fields.

2
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.470
Whatever grows by itself is left
free for the poor and for animals.

3
00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:15.260
Yet in Genesis, God gives the first humans
a striking word about the rest of creation.

4
00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:17.470
The word is dominion.

5
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:21.910
So if the earth belongs to God, what
are humans allowed to do with it?

6
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:26.250
In this mission, you'll read two verses
from Genesis that seem to pull in different

7
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.370
directions.

8
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:32.280
Then you'll see what Jewish law says
about trees and about resting the land.

9
00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:37.490
Your mission: find out what Jewish teaching
allows humans to do with God's earth.
